        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Pictures**, ComfyUI's **Create List**, joins the three pictures in order, and **Combine** uploads them. Seedream 5.0 Lite puts the host in the kitchen with the burger, at `9:16` and `2K`. It takes up to 6 pictures.\n\nThis workflow made `example_workflows/assets/dreamina/host-in-kitchen.webp`, which **video-05-animate-a-saved-image** starts from."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
